silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_05_validation_and_shapes_sections_02_shacl_as_implementation_concrete_anchor_1 silm:hasExample "In 'ConcreteAnchor — 02_shacl_as_implementation #1', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, In section '\\Acr{SHACL' the bare symbol RDFGraph anchors to CitedVetRecordObject: The vet-record after citation key local-mittens-example-anchor-2026 is assigned and its source boundary is declared: this file is about Mittens, not Mittens itself. Same physical document; different Forge standing.." .
